{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Dudaim</b> in gematria equals <b>ke-adam</b> (like Adam): 248. In all the names of the tribes there is no samekh except in Yosef — a hint that he is the adversary of Esav. And in all of them there is no ayin except in Shimon, on account of (Proverbs 6:3) \"and the eye of the adulterer watches for twilight,\" because of the incident of Zimri."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:26.203162520Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}